    rdfs:label "Access Collapse: MOBILE+ → STRAINED → IMPAIRED → CRITICAL_ACCESS_FAILURE" ;
    rdfs:comment "Tracks progressive transportation access collapse. In rural and low-income urban areas, loss of a vehicle (breakdown, repossession) or transit program changes can instantly eliminate care access for patients dependent on dialysis, oncology, or specialty chronic disease management. The MOBILE+ baseline requires confirmed transportation before collapse can be signaled." ;
